      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "友人が昨日、彼が女性と一緒にタクシーに乗って食事に行くのを見たと言いました。",
      "text_en": "A friend told me that yesterday he saw my boyfriend take a taxi with a woman to go out for a meal.",
