    {
      "id": "story_1592_p0_c2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "彼は昨日、食べる時間がないと言っていましたから。",
      "text_en": "After work, I went to his office and saw him leave in a taxi with a woman.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あれ\" data-defn=\"あれ (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">彼</span><rt>あれ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"きのう\" data-defn=\"きのう (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">昨日</span><rt>きのう</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たべる\" data-defn=\"to eat; to live on (e.g. a salary)/to live off/to subsist on\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">食べる</span><rt>たべる</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"じかん\" data-defn=\"じかん (word)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">時間</span><rt>じかん</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"が\" data-defn=\"subject marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">が</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ない\" data-defn=\"not / non-existent\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ない</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"と\" data-defn=\"and / with\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">と</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"いっっ\" data-defn=\"to say/to utter/to declare; to name/to call (言う)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">言っ</span><rt>いっっ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"て\" data-defn=\"conjunctive particle (and / -ing)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">て</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"い\" data-defn=\"to be / to exist (auxiliary verb)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">い</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ました\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (past: did / -ed)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ました</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"から\" data-defn=\"from / because / since\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">から</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
